<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan forex reserves rise to $1.711 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan forex reserves rise to $1.711 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's foreign exchange reserves rose to $1.711 billion on March 8 from $1.679 billion on March 1, compared to $2.022 billion a year ago, the State (central) Bank of Pakistan said on Saturday.</p>
</text>
